  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing recovery of the regionally significant hawksbill nesting population in Barbados</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The recipient will conduct all night patrols on the national index nesting beach for hawksbills June 1- Sept 30 and once nightly patrols on all other high density hawksbill to collect nesting data and protect nesting females. The USFWS will work closely with grantee in setting goals, priorities, and developing budgets, and will provide assistance as needed and requested in engaging with National Governmental and other institutions to improve collaboration and conservation outcomes.</narrative>
  </description>
